    {
      "id": "99f84b9b-dbf3-4c33-83c8-ee531b1e20d0",
      "name": "Sticky Note 062c03a5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        414,
        158
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## Branch L — Google Sheets (authoritative, phase A)\n\nIncrements the Daily Stats NRR counter. Unchanged.\n\nNot idempotent: the counter is bumped unconditionally, so a redelivered TAG_ATTACHED double-counts. Branch S is idempotent by construction, so the two disagree exactly when an event is redelivered — which makes that a useful divergence signal, not noise.",
        "height": 488,
        "width": 524
      }
