        "content": "## Branch S — Supabase (phase A)\n\nNRR records a REPLY and nothing else: no CRM lead, no OOO episode, and final_outcome is not touched — a lost outcome is an explicit human decision (ADR-0015).\n\ndaily_stats.ooo_count and the NRR counter stay sequencer-reported EVENT counts. They are not derived from this table and must never be mixed with CRM figures.\n\nNeeds its own Bison calls: branch L never fetches the reply, it only counts.\n\nonError: continueRegularOutput — must never break branch L.\nRepo: docs/reference/n8n/ooo-phase-a.md",
